<title>UK: German inland gas oil weaker in strong competition.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil weaker in strong competition.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.7625)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     33.10/33.50     18.78/19.01  33.30/33.70</p>
<p> BREMEN		33.10/33.50     18.78/19.01   33.30/33.70</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.30/33.70     18.89/19.12   33.50/33.90</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   34.00/34.40     19.29/19.52   34.20/34.60</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   34.00/34.30     19.29/19.52   34.20/34.60</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  36.00/36.40     20.43/20.65   36.00/36.40</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were marked lower again on Wednesday as continued dollar strength kept competition for business strong with buyers staying relaxed.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
